# What not to upload to Vercel. The CLI uploads the whole workspace — the web app imports
# `@nap/shared` by source, so `apps/web` alone would not build — and without this that
# includes a gigabyte of `node_modules` and a local `.next`, which exceeds the upload limit.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo

# The API's business, not the browser's.
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
railway.json
infra
test
docs
